  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Hi Beautiful!<br>Pinkie Flamingo Welcomes You To Ciao Bella<br>4 Kings / 1 Queen / 6 Sets Full Over Full Bunks<br>4 Bikes<br><br>“Hi Beautiful!...Or maybe it means “Hello Gorgeous”? Pinkie Flamingo pondered the true meaning of “Ciao Bella” as she reminisced about her visits to Italy. Beautiful people, beautiful food and beautiful scenery… “What a great name for my newest guest nest!” Synonymous with classic style and charm, your soon-to-be favorite beach house ever is just sitting here waiting to be the chosen one. With both new owners and new management…Ciao Bella in the fabulous, exclusive Seacrest Community stands ready to be the stage of your next 30A vacation. Benvenuto!<br><br>Pinkie Flamingo zig-zagged along the famous winding coastal highway in her hot pink Gem car as the sun shimmered and sparkled atop the gentle, blue-green waves of the Gulf. Composed of a diverse array of charming beach communities and quaint eclectic neighborhoods, the beaches along Florida Scenic Hwy 30A in South Walton County in Northwest Florida have a collective appeal to just about everyone. Each of the sixteen neighborhoods has its own unique style and affords a different vacation experience. She was looking for just the right beach house…one that can truly deliver an over-the-top vacation experience. <br><br>Popular for its fabulous proximity to upscale shopping and dining and for its pristine beaches, the desirable beach community of Seacrest boasts many amenities including Seacrest Lagoon, the largest private community pool on 30A sporting 378,000 gallons of refreshing water in a 12,000 square feet area complete with lounge chairs, umbrellas, and covered eating areas. Pinkie Flamingo easily navigated down 30A and turned in at the iconic lifeguard stand that trademarked the entrance to Seacrest. This family-friendly vacation zone was known to savvy visitors smart enough to have cracked the code on a great vacation. <br><br>And here it is…the ultimate venue for you and 18 of your closest friends! <br>Rumour has it this house was one of the most popular in the area last year.<br><br>Pinkie could not get over how primo this location was…Nestled between the popular Seacrest/Rosemary/Alys communities to the East and Watersound/Seagrove to the West, fabulous local shopping and dining is all just a bike-ride or walk away. The free seasonal beach shuttle makes it all quite accessible as well. Pinkie's guests at Ciao Bella will enjoy full resort access to the community's outstanding amenities including the private deeded beach access.<br><br>Here's The Layout…<br><br>Home Highlights<br>Three Level Private Home<br>Cozy Front Porch with Fireplace<br>Private Driveway Holds 4 Cars<br>Upper Sun Deck<br>Propane Gas Grill<br>Sea Shed with Beach Gear<br>4 Bikes<br>4 Backpack Beach Chairs, Umbrella, Beach Wagon<br>Multiple Gathering Vignettes/Porches/Balconies<br>Solid Surface Coastal Flooring Throughout<br>Modern Coastal Décor<br><br>Level 1<br>Open Concept Living Area Featuring Entertainment/Dining/Cooking<br>Modern Fully-Equipped Kitchen<br>Fireplace / Icemaker<br>Expansive Kitchen Island Gathering Spot With 4 Stools<br>Dining Table Seats 10 <br>King Master Suite with Built-In Twin/Twin Bunks<br><br>Level 2<br>King Master Suite with Built-In Twin/Twin Bunks, Fireplace and Balcony<br>Large Master Bathroom with Dual Sinks / Soaker Tub<br>King Guest Bedroom with Attached Bathroom<br>Queen Guest Bedroom with Attached Bathroom<br>King Guest Bedroom with Attached Bathroom<br>Laundry Room<br><br>Level 3<br>Bunk Room Featuring 2 Sets Twin Over Twin Bunks<br>Pool Table / Beverage Center<br>Powder Room<br>Sun Deck<br><br>Bellisimo!<br><br>Maybe it's time to stop looking and time to start booking!<br><br>Makin' My Way Along 30A…Seacrest<br><br>All of Pinkie's Properties Have A Few Things In Common<br>•\tMust Be 25 To Book<br>•\tNo Smoking <br>•\tCancellation OK 30 Days Prior To Check-In<br>•\tSheets & Bath Towels Included…BYO Beach Towels<br>•\tAll Kitchens Fully-Equipped With Cooking/Eating Utensils… BYO Spices & Food<br>•\tBasic Essentials Starter Set Only…TP, Paper Towels, Trash Bags, Soaps, Etc …Depending on Length of Stay You May Need More",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "🦩Book Me Baby! Hi Beautiful~Ciao Bella at Seacrest Beach🦩"
        }
      ],
